title: mf repo update-config
tags: [[CLI command]] Configuration
kind: reference
summary: Merge the repository defaults into one repository's configuration

Merges `~/.config/metafolder/daemon/repo-default/` into the repository's
`.metafolder/config/` ([[Repository configuration]]). The path names its
`.metafolder/` directory or the root holding it; no daemon is involved. Prints
`configuration created`, `configuration updated` or `configuration already up to
date`; a conflict leaves `config/` as it was, lists the files (full paths) on
stderr with the git commands that finish the merge by hand
([[Updating the configuration]]), and exits 1.
The first run on a repository from before `config/` moves its `schema.json` and
`metadata-map.toml` there, each said on a `moved … into config/` line.
